        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DL35 3-1/2\" Drop Latch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis drop latch is a versatile security solution that can be used to lock doors including shutters, double doors, closets, cabinets or furniture. Made from quality solid brass material for a long lasting life. This 3-1/2\" drop latch is easy to use and install with the included screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-DL35_size.gif?v=1704354748\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DL35 Drop Latch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-DL35-how-to-use.gif?v=1704354748\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"How to Use a Drop Latch \">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DL35 Drop Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Bar Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Pivot Plate Height: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Pivot Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish #8 x 1\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>Available in 7 finishes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DL35.pdf?v=1704262307\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DL35 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
